Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:02:34.40,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs54\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,24)}▍{\r\fn得意黑\fs54}2026 美网 男单第一轮
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:02:34.40,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,92)}布云朝克特 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}2 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}1 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}1{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38} 霍达尔 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.32,0:00:03.60,EN,,0,0,0,,You just defeated the number 12 seed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.32,0:00:03.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,你刚刚击败了 12 号种子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.60,0:00:09.00,EN,,0,0,0,,in Rafael Jodar in straight sets
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.60,0:00:09.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,霍达尔 直落三盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.16,0:00:14.32,EN,,0,0,0,,even through the slight rain delay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.16,0:00:14.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,中间还赶上了一次雨中断
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.32,0:00:17.52,EN,,0,0,0,,What does this win mean to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.32,0:00:17.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,这场胜利对你意味着什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.52,0:00:19.76,EN,,0,0,0,,Actually I was really lucky loser
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.52,0:00:19.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,其实我真的是个幸运落败者
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.76,0:00:21.92,EN,,0,0,0,,so and yeah it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.76,0:00:21.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.92,0:00:24.08,EN,,0,0,0,,was a little bit tough you know is everything
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.92,0:00:24.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,是有点难 你知道 所有事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.08,0:00:26.88,EN,,0,0,0,,is on my side and then just rain
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.08,0:00:26.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,都站在我这边 然后下雨了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.88,0:00:28.88,EN,,0,0,0,,and a little bit stop and then make me think
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.88,0:00:28.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,中间停了一阵 让我有点乱想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.88,0:00:30.88,EN,,0,0,0,,a bit but you know we just do our job
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.88,0:00:30.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我们只是做好自己的事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.88,0:00:33.20,EN,,0,0,0,,very focused and then save the energy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.88,0:00:33.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,保持专注 保存体力
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.20,0:00:35.12,EN,,0,0,0,,and then ready to come back anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.20,0:00:35.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,随时准备回到场上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.12,0:00:36.32,EN,,0,0,0,,So I'm really happy for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.12,0:00:36.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我真的很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.32,0:00:40.24,EN,,0,0,0,,And then you know it looks looks like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.32,0:00:40.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且你知道 这看起来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.24,0:00:43.12,EN,,0,0,0,,like very easy but for sure in my in my mind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.24,0:00:43.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,好像很轻松 但在我心里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.12,0:00:45.84,EN,,0,0,0,,in my heart it's like many many emotions
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.12,0:00:45.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,其实是很多很多情绪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.84,0:00:47.68,EN,,0,0,0,,is very very very nervous actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.84,0:00:47.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的非常非常紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.68,0:00:48.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.68,0:00:48.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.80,0:00:49.84,EN,,0,0,0,,So many emotions
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.80,0:00:49.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,那么多情绪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.84,0:00:52.32,EN,,0,0,0,,because yesterday you just found out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.84,0:00:52.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为你昨天才刚知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.32,0:00:54.40,EN,,0,0,0,,that you were playing in the main draw
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.32,0:00:54.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,自己能打正赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.40,0:00:56.40,EN,,0,0,0,,as a lucky loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.40,0:00:56.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,以幸运落败者的身份
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.40,0:00:57.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Where were you? Were you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.40,0:00:57.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,你当时在哪呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.28,0:00:59.60,EN,,0,0,0,,on your couch watching a movie?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.28,0:00:59.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,窝在沙发上看电影吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.60,0:01:01.12,EN,,0,0,0,,Were you packing your bags
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.60,0:01:01.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,还是在收拾行李
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.12,0:01:01.92,EN,,0,0,0,,to leave New York?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.12,0:01:01.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,准备离开纽约？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.92,0:01:02.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Where were you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.92,0:01:02.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,你当时在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.40,0:01:04.00,EN,,0,0,0,,when you found out this news that you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.40,0:01:04.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,听到这个消息的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.00,0:01:05.84,EN,,0,0,0,,would be playing in the main draw?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.00,0:01:05.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,说你可以打正赛了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.84,0:01:07.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, actually you know
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.84,0:01:07.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的 其实
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.44,0:01:08.88,EN,,0,0,0,,after I lost the last round
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.44,0:01:08.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,我输掉资格赛最后一轮之后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.88,0:01:10.16,EN,,0,0,0,,the qualies you know I'm super tired
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.88,0:01:10.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,你知道 我累坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.16,0:01:11.20,EN,,0,0,0,,and we take a day off
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.16,0:01:11.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们休息了一天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.20,0:01:12.32,EN,,0,0,0,,and then second day we supposed
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.20,0:01:12.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,第二天本来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.32,0:01:14.56,EN,,0,0,0,,to take a day off and I see few guys pull out
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.32,0:01:14.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,也想休息 但我看到有人退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.56,0:01:16.16,EN,,0,0,0,,and we make decision to come back
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.56,0:01:16.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们就决定回来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.16,0:01:18.40,EN,,0,0,0,,on court you know chill with my coach
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.16,0:01:18.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,回到场上 和我的教练
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.40,0:01:19.60,EN,,0,0,0,,and my fitness coach
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.40,0:01:19.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有体能教练待着
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.60,0:01:21.04,EN,,0,0,0,,and then you know we just spend all
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.60,0:01:21.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们就把所有时间
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.04,0:01:23.28,EN,,0,0,0,,the time together and try to try
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.04,0:01:23.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,都待在一起 试着
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.28,0:01:24.80,EN,,0,0,0,,to do some work you know in case I
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.28,0:01:24.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,做点训练 万一
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.80,0:01:27.28,EN,,0,0,0,,have to play but I'm really lucky yesterday
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.80,0:01:27.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,真要上场呢 昨天我很幸运
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.28,0:01:29.84,EN,,0,0,0,,they tell me I can play and you know I
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.28,0:01:29.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们告诉我可以打了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.84,0:01:31.68,EN,,0,0,0,,was every day I come 8:00 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.84,0:01:31.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我每天早上八点到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.68,0:01:33.44,EN,,0,0,0,,and then I go back home probably 8:00
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.68,0:01:33.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,大概晚上八点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.44,0:01:33.76,EN,,0,0,0,,p.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.44,0:01:33.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,才回家
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.76,0:01:34.00,EN,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.76,0:01:34.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,你知道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.00,0:01:37.36,EN,,0,0,0,,I was ready to die like zero energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.00,0:01:37.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,我快累死了 完全没有力气
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.36,0:01:40.08,EN,,0,0,0,,And yeah, when I heard I have I can play
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.36,0:01:40.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,而当我听到我能打的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.08,0:01:41.68,EN,,0,0,0,,with Lucky Loser, I feel like, wow,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.08,0:01:41.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,以幸运落败者的身份 我心想 哇
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.68,0:01:42.40,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm super excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.68,0:01:42.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,我太兴奋了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.40,0:01:43.52,EN,,0,0,0,,You know, it doesn't matter 8 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.40,0:01:43.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,你知道 早上八点也好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.52,0:01:45.84,EN,,0,0,0,,or 8:00 p.m. I can be here all day, 24 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.52,0:01:45.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,晚上八点也好 我能待 24 小时
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.84,0:01:49.28,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.84,0:01:49.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.28,0:01:54.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, you just won your first Grand Slam win
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.28,0:01:54.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,你刚拿下大满贯正赛第一胜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.64,0:01:56.72,EN,,0,0,0,,and you're off to the second round.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.64,0:01:56.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且晋级了第二轮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.72,0:01:58.48,EN,,0,0,0,,What do you want New York to know
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.72,0:01:58.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,你想让纽约知道你的哪一面
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.48,0:01:59.92,EN,,0,0,0,,about you that they don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.48,0:01:59.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,是他们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.92,0:02:01.04,EN,,0,0,0,,about you already?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.92,0:02:01.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,还不知道的？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.04,0:02:03.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Actually I really love New York you know
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.04,0:02:03.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,其实我真的很爱纽约
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.84,0:02:06.80,EN,,0,0,0,,I it's almost my favorite like grand slam
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.84,0:02:06.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,这几乎是我最喜欢的大满贯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.80,0:02:08.08,EN,,0,0,0,,because I make like
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.80,0:02:08.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.08,0:02:09.04,EN,,0,0,0,,I played two years here
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.08,0:02:09.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,在这儿打过两年
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.04,0:02:11.44,EN,,0,0,0,,and then I always I make both main draw
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.04,0:02:11.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,两次都进了正赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.44,0:02:12.64,EN,,0,0,0,,and I didn't win any match
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.44,0:02:12.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,但一场都没赢过
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.64,0:02:14.40,EN,,0,0,0,,and this year even I lost qualies
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.64,0:02:14.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,而今年我连资格赛都输了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.40,0:02:16.24,EN,,0,0,0,,and I play main draw again and I win.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.40,0:02:16.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,却又进了正赛 而且赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.24,0:02:18.40,EN,,0,0,0,,So I mean I love here and then thanks
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.24,0:02:18.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我爱这里 也谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.40,0:02:20.48,EN,,0,0,0,,for the crowd everything everybody
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.40,0:02:20.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,现场的每一位观众
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.48,0:02:22.32,EN,,0,0,0,,to come out to watch and support
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.48,0:02:22.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,来到这里看球 支持我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.32,0:02:25.04,EN,,0,0,0,,and hope see you next round.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.32,0:02:25.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,希望下一轮再见
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.04,0:02:26.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, anything can happen here
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.04,0:02:26.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,在美网 什么都可能发生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.80,0:02:28.64,EN,,0,0,0,,at the US Open and Bu,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.80,0:02:28.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,而布云朝克特
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.64,0:02:31.04,EN,,0,0,0,,you are headed to the second round.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.64,0:02:31.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,你晋级第二轮了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.04,0:02:34.62,EN,,0,0,0,,New York, make some noise for
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.04,0:02:34.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,纽约 为他欢呼吧
